Text_en:
The Theresienwiese in #Muenchen can accommodate up to 400,000 people. 

The photo was taken during the peak number which the 
@PolizeiMuenchen
 estimated at 250k. An obvious mistake. 

The number should be corrected to around 60-70,000. 
@PolizeiBavaria

